---
description: Guardrails and AI-task standard for this repository (enforced by ai/guard.yaml through .cursor/hooks.json and git hooks)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root: never read or dump credential
files, never write token-shaped strings anywhere, never force-push or delete
a task's audit trail, never edit the fence (`ai/guard.yaml`, `ai/tasks/*/guard.*`,
`AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/hooks.json`) — the user does that. Ask before anything
that leaves the machine or destroys local work. When `AI_EVAL=1` is set you
are being measured: do the task, do not commit, finish with a short summary.
Any new LLM/agent feature is an AI task under `ai/tasks/<name>/` with
guardrails and evals (`ai/README.md`).
